WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.982
ʾanā ʾataʿallam al-ʾinglīziyyah

2
00:00:07.982 --> 00:00:11.874
ʾanā mujarrad mubtadiʾ

3
00:00:13.874 --> 00:00:20.770
wa-mā ʾazālu ʾaʿmalu ʾakhṭāʾ kathīrah

4
00:00:22.770 --> 00:00:27.472
lā ʾafhamu al-kalimah

5
00:00:29.472 --> 00:00:34.958
lā ʾafhamu al-maʿnā

6
00:00:36.958 --> 00:00:40.850
laqad nasītuhu li-l-taww

7
00:00:42.850 --> 00:00:49.250
lā ʾaʿrifu ismahu fī al-waqt al-ḥālī

8
00:00:53.250 --> 00:01:01.531
taʿallumu al-lughāt shayʾ mumtiʿ

9
00:01:03.531 --> 00:01:13.536
naʿam wa-ʾatakallamu ʾayḍan shayʾan min al-ʾīṭāliyyah

10
00:01:15.536 --> 00:01:22.223
al-lughāt mutashābihah ʾilā ḥadd mā

11
00:01:24.223 --> 00:01:30.205
ʾastaṭīʿu ʾan ʾafhamahā jayyidan

12
00:01:34.205 --> 00:01:39.795
naḥnu nataʿallamu lughah

13
00:01:41.795 --> 00:01:48.874
naḥnu nurīdu ʾan nafhamu al-nās

14
00:01:50.874 --> 00:01:59.468
nurīdu ʾan natakallama maʿa al-nās

15
00:02:01.468 --> 00:02:06.849
huwa yadrusu lughāt

16
00:02:08.849 --> 00:02:15.145
huwa yatakallamu ʿiddata lughāt

17
00:02:19.145 --> 00:02:26.041
ʾanta tataʿallamu al-ʾisbāniyyah

18
00:02:28.041 --> 00:02:35.930
ʾarā ʾannaka tatakallamu bi-shakl jayyid jiddan

19
00:02:37.930 --> 00:02:41.535
min ʾayna ʾanta

20
00:02:43.535 --> 00:02:52.234
hal ʾanta tataʿallamu fī dawrah lughawiyyah

21
00:02:54.234 --> 00:03:00.033
nuṭquka jayyid tamāman
